---
description: Preserve Finge as an evidence-based companion to FishCast
alwaysApply: true
---
Keep FishCast models and training upstream. Finge reads exported artifacts only.
Compute statistics in Python, never in the language model. Distinguish climate and nowcast tracks.
Keep synthetic examples labeled, preserve artifact fingerprints, and reject non-finite metrics.
Do not invent confidence intervals or treat validation scores as held-out test results.
Keep XAI_API_KEY server-side. Add meaningful adapter regression tests when changing data contracts.
Run python -m unittest discover -s tests -v and node --check web/app.js.
